PPOnline/
---------
New code for this project (Slippi-style online menus for Project+). Parts are ported from
Brawlback-Online (MIT, see above):
- PPOnline/source/netmenu.cpp: the Nintendo WFC login bypass and the Wi-Fi CSS timer/error
  hooks, from Brawlback-Online/source/Rollback_Hooks.cpp, namespace NetMenu.
- PPOnline/source/rel.cpp: the Syriinge 0.6 plugin entry, after Brawlback-Online/source/rel.cpp
  (project-plus-fork).
- PPOnline/Makefile: from Brawlback-Online/Makefile.

Reverse-engineering references (no code copied): refs/brawl-decomp symbol maps, BrawlHeaders,
the Project+ v3.2 codeset sources on its SD card, and Slippi's design (copied as UX, not code).
PPOnline/source/boot_menu.cpp (boot to the ONLINE page) follows Orca's approach and uses its
addresses (Orca, GPL-3.0-or-later: ORCA.md "Boot and friends from the menus" and
Data/Sys/Orca/PPLUS32.patches), with attribution; no Orca code is copied.

Game assets
-----------
Nothing from the game or from Project+ is stored here. All visible text is printed through the
game's own message system (MuMsg) with its own fonts; no images are added.
